				4.40
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				2.19
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἔμ᾽ ἀ. καὶ βίαιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					21.128
				</span></i>
